 I`m now working with more simple and informative models. But still, I`m not sure what is the best way to include the year factor variable as site covariate in the colext framework.

Any ideas of how to do that?

My solution was to create a matrix similar to this ( this is just an example, I have at least 7 secondary occasions at each year):

